{
    "title": "Text or Die",
    "description": "The longest answer wins! Answer each question with the longest answer you can think of to build your tower and escape the rising waters!  Text or Die is a typing game with a twist: you need to outlast your opponents and avoid getting eaten! This texting game has tons of brain-teasing and addicting typing practice!\r\n\r\nGameplay\r\n\u2022Join a tournament\r\n\u2022Start typing words\r\n\u2022Type the longest words and build the highest blocks\r\n\u2022Survive each round as the water rises\r\n\u2022Become the ultimate word text machine!\r\n\r\nGame Features\r\n\r\n\u2022 Unlock fantastic characters, items, and blocks as rewards in this taping game\r\n\u2022 Can\u2019t keep up with the others? Get a hint and keep typing words!\r\n\u2022 No mercy! Call the pirates and watch your enemies sink!\r\n\u2022 Bonus level: Type as many words as you can think of and get the grand prize! \r\n\r\nIf you want to improve your word guessing game, this is just a great time filler and an excellent typing practice. Texting games have never been so challenging and addictive! Have fun typing like a pro, and beating every tournament in one of the most popular typing games. \r\n\r\nBecome the master of fast typing in the open seas and enjoy this addicting word game for free, and we\u2019ll be keeping an eye on your feedback for missing words to make it the best texting game ever. \r\n\r\nNow, it\u2019s time to text or die!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The longest answer wins! Answer each question with the longest answer you can think of to build your tower and escape the rising waters!  Text or Die is a typing game with a twist: you need to outlast your opponents and avoid getting eaten! This texting game has tons of brain-teasing and addicting typing practice!<br><br>Gameplay<br>\u2022Join a tournament<br>\u2022Start typing words<br>\u2022Type the longest words and build the highest blocks<br>\u2022Survive each round as the water rises<br>\u2022Become the ultimate word text machine!<br><br>Game Features<br><br>\u2022 Unlock fantastic characters, items, and blocks as rewards in this taping game<br>\u2022 Can\u2019t keep up with the others? Get a hint and keep typing words!<br>\u2022 No mercy! Call the pirates and watch your enemies sink!<br>\u2022 Bonus level: Type as many words as you can think of and get the grand prize! <br><br>If you want to improve your word guessing game, this is just a great time filler and an excellent typing practice. Texting games have never been so challenging and addictive! Have fun typing like a pro, and beating every tournament in one of the most popular typing games. <br><br>Become the master of fast typing in the open seas and enjoy this addicting word game for free, and we\u2019ll be keeping an eye on your feedback for missing words to make it the best texting game ever. <br><br>Now, it\u2019s time to text or die!",
